        "She insisted on …",
        "I want to apologise for …",
        "Can you remind me about …?",
        "How do you spell …?",
        "He speaks with a strong accent."
      ],
      "note": "admit, deny and insist are how you report what people said WITHOUT repeating every word — they carry the speaker's attitude."
